1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
This is a gift he'll actually use.

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:05,240
He already has a drill, a hammer, everything.

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,480
What do you give the man who fixes it all himself?

4
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,480
Give him something he'll actually use.

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:13,960
A chimney sweep kit with flexible rods for the stove, cabin or house.

6
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,480
He puts it together, tries it that same evening.

7
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:20,600
And you see it on him, that smile, when the gift hits the mark.

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,360
Not just another thing in a box.

9
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,680
A gift he talks about next time the stove is lit.

10
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,880
Chimney sweep kit with flexible rods.

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:31,440
The perfect gift for the man who does it all himself.
